0..76 Comment "// The twin of `model/desc/binding-field.gandr`: a freshness condition names"
77..136 Comment "// an atom, and the variable a binding field binds is none."
138..215 Comment "/// Garbage collection over a field, `new(bind x . q) <=> q where x # q`: `x`"
216..292 Comment "/// is the variable the `pi+` binder binds, which substitution instantiates,"
293..370 Comment "/// not an atom swapping renames, so no abstraction of the rule abstracts it."
371..448 Comment "/// The description check refuses the condition as naming an unknown atom, an"
449..498 Comment "/// ill-formed description. The law without it is"
499..548 Comment "/// `model/desc/binding-field.gandr`\'s `Vacuous`."
